  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "體育－飛輪有氧",
    "sub_ename": "X-BIKING EXERCISE",
    "describe_ch": "一、飛輪有氧熱量消耗可達到600卡╱每小時，而且能加快體內新陳代謝的速度，強化心肺功能，並可迅速燃燒脂肪來達到減重目的。\r\n二、模擬戶外登山車設計，配合震撼動感音樂，藉由騎行運動中的各種模擬路況及動作變化，達到腿部、臀部的肌肉鍛鍊及各種騎行姿勢達到手部、腹部以及背部肌群達到充分訓練。",
    "describe_eh": "First, X-bike exercise can burn calorie reach 600 / per hour, accelerate internal speed of metabolism to consume, strengthen the heart and lungs function, and can burn the fat to achieve the goal of reducing heavily rapidly.Second, the simulation outdoor mountaineering bike is designed, cooperate and shake the dynamic music, by riding various kinds of simulation road conditions and movement change walking in sports, the muscle which reaches the shank, buttock forges the chain and various kinds of and rides conduct posture and reaches the hand, belly and back skin group to reach and fully train.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 1.0
  },
  "targets": [
    {
      "seq": 1,
      "describe_ch": "利用飛輪有氧以團體激勵氣氛，讓學生在活潑有趣的課程中，加快體內新陳代謝的速度，強化心肺循環適能，並迅速燃燒脂肪來達到減重目的。",
      "describe_en": "Utilize X-bike encourage atmosphere with groupexercise, let student among lively interesting course, accelerate internal speed of metabolism is circulation right to strengthen cardiovascular endurance, burn fat achieve the goal of reducing heavily rapidly"
    }
  ],
